      "uid": "zhcn:72e2b1c577239148da7ce3ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八成是因为她有好一段时间没有外出，\n被人将此夸大其辞后以奇怪的方式传播出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da30fdb66606744c2e0d38f4872b37203d8b15d4238320820edd6fa6801385fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
