      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:504c206ba151ff35a8bb04ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……没错，其实她从几天前开始便感到\n双腿有些不适，所以一直在悄悄地疗养。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b79aa85e1b2c1d63174c0564b7b2f1aabf5242dfae42445e175291dc086c371",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24fdf4533f49014d8479d31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谣言完全不是事实，我们并不打算取消参赛。\n正因如此，听到这些与事实完全不同的\n传言让我非常在意──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a32b9c814b682d56ecc814058f6fa18da1647455ef84fb968a11543dd5aea63c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070202.json",
      "json_path": [
