    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22be471d6dfa7d2e6317bdb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天就是“日本德比”了。因今年备受期待，\n最具冠军相的赛马娘放弃参赛，\n可以说是完全无法预测走向呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "842c44d0045a34b205d2033b20eb1cef218d4268a3b5dcfaab7c0ac5a1bf21d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2330f9fc227a6b2e910157",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "解说员",
      "source_fingerprint": "4008bec707b5da8466b977449da2d4b922f1f6bbab6cceca9982aaa914d2e188",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b90815b4bde325ed08ff145",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是说啊，我预测这会是场混战──\n不管谁赢都不奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d67cdad9a0990aa4bc3e306c96a5cbd06ec23866579d05c7437d8286bb06d6fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
