      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b257823ed007827bb6b207fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征的双眼，\n比平时还要更加闪耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f917f88f0667360d8b4cdde9cf39b7d9165a6400bcc7d4b0e209c0818f8731",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a4e09e54c229df3b7cac5b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟“德比赛马娘”的称号非常重要。\n要是能够拿下，说不定会被选为\n“国外远征计划”的成员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d4a48cd781b911f8a21a03dc45eb38b6fd2fa0a4a61eabbf845ef5d54962ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f549dd2ab4c2747b3181ada",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去赢得胜利吧，天狼星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bb48cde07aa77e60d4df822d4e4cb3a7ac4ba2309aae277e807cf2a63a142cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070203.json",
      "json_path": [
